        "id": 2022314
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-30T12:45:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we explicitly don\u0027t support kexec. See e.g. pKVM-ARM documentation in Documentation/virt/kvm/arm/pkvm.rst: \"Since the host is unable to tear down the hypervisor when pKVM is enabled, hibernation (``CONFIG_HIBERNATION``) and kexec (``CONFIG_KEXEC``) will fail with ``-EBUSY``.\"",
      "parentUuid": "0587f287_76cf9410",
